1
00:00:02,802 --> 00:00:05,042
(Leonard:)I was unstoppable.

2
00:00:05,039 --> 00:00:06,439
(Leonard:)I mean, I was...
I was on fire.

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:10,080
(Leonard:)It was like my mind and my body
were totally connected,

4
00:00:10,077 --> 00:00:13,777
like-like athletes must feel
when they're in the zone.

5
00:00:13,781 --> 00:00:17,151
(Penny:)Again, it was
miniature golf.

6
00:00:17,151 --> 00:00:19,621
(Leonard:)Admit it, you're a
little turned on.

7
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,650
(Penny:)You can't be this proud.

8
00:00:21,655 --> 00:00:23,085
(Leonard:)Why not?

9
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:27,090
(Penny:)Because I beat you.

10
00:00:27,094 --> 00:00:28,864
(Leonard:)Hey.
Hi.

11
00:00:28,863 --> 00:00:30,293
(Sheldon:)Oh, good. You're back.

12
00:00:30,297 --> 00:00:34,667
(Amy:)We have some
exciting news.

13
00:00:34,668 --> 00:00:36,368
(Leonard:)Okay.

14
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:40,070
(Sheldon:)As you know, Amy and I have
been together a long time,

15
00:00:40,074 --> 00:00:41,944
(Sheldon:)and a lot of things

16
00:00:41,942 --> 00:00:45,882
(Sheldon:)I never thought possible
now seem possible.

17
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,710
(Leonard:)Okay...

18
00:00:48,716 --> 00:00:51,986
(Amy:)After a careful evaluation
of our relationship,

19
00:00:51,986 --> 00:01:02,026
(Amy:)we decided that the time was
right to take a step forward.

